{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"代码已写入 [5.py](/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/15/5.py)。\n\n`main()` 现在按可见结构解析右下角色环、边缘光源和灰色对角镜段，并执行反射加换色的确定性模拟；`generate_input()` 会随机化网格尺寸、图例长度、光源边、光源颜色、反射次数、镜段长度与两种镜面朝向，并用回溯约束避免重叠、越界和退化样例。\n\n已执行并通过：\n```bash\npython - <<'PY'\nfrom importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport hashlib\nimport numpy as np\n\np = Path(\"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/15/5.py\")\nmod = SourceFileLoader(\"new_arc_task\", str(p)).load_module()\nsigs = set()\nfor i in range(100):\n    inp = mod.generate_input()\n    out = mod.main(inp)\n    assert isinstance(inp, np.ndarray)\n    assert isinstance(out, np.ndarray)\n    assert inp.ndim == 2 and max(inp.shape) <= 30, f\"input grid exceeds 30x30: {inp.shape}\"\n    assert out.ndim == 2 and max(out.shape) <= 30, f\"output grid exceeds 30x30: {out.shape}\"\n    sigs.add(hashlib.md5(inp.tobytes() + str(inp.shape).encode()).hexdigest())\nprint(\"variants\", len(sigs))\nassert len(sigs) >= 20\nPY\npython -m py_compile \"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/15/5.py\"\n```\n\n结果是 `variants 100`，并且验证产生的 `__pycache__` 已清理。"}}
